  "body": "As mentioned at https://github.com/whatwg/encoding/pull/175#discussion_r287275701 this is indeed something that should be done.\r\n\r\nThe basic process here is:\r\n\r\n* Add the ID of the flag `<dfn>` explicitly so that it doesn't change.\r\n* Remove the word \"flag\" from the `<dfn>` and adjust surrounding wording accordingly to make sense for booleans.\r\n* Ensure \"flag\" is no longer in the document or only in the non-boolean sense.",
